        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-771, Square Cabinet Knob with Square Lines</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nContemporary without being overly modern, this RK International made Square Cabinet Knob is the perfect choice for people looking for a fresh take on cabinet hardware. The square shape is made accessible to more traditional style homes with the rounded edges and the square grooves. It is available in  7/8 inch and 1-1/16 inch sizes. Choose from any of the 6 available finishes to achieve the look you desire.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-771 Square Cabinet Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-771:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 7/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-770:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
